{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-07/1059905/block/singleImage/3246454/wm/04-003.jpg?updatedAt=1792723499\"/><figcaption>長沙灣蘇屋邨發生自殺事件。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>長沙灣蘇屋邨周四（22日）發生自殺事件。上午11時51分，一名男子報案，指發現其72歲姓盧母親在壽菊樓住所廁所內懷疑以一條電線上吊自縊，已將她救下。 救援人員接報到場，女事主當時不省人事，隨即將她送往明愛醫院搶救，惟其後證實不治。 據悉，女事主生前有病在身，現場留有遺書。事件原因仍待調查，確實死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.920358+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:44:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:58:23.128238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:05.007939+00:00","content_hash":"e7a3a1525b406166353390167b53c86b49dda3ea8f17ad1c54e34e2e81d7ee4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.920358+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}